OL,4,BThe local boy aiming to be at the      
OL,5,Bheart of Cardiff's derby aims          
OL,6,GRubin Colwill is used to being in the  
OL,7,Gcentre of things.                      
OL,9,FHe has been the focus of an ongoing    
OL,10,Fargument over his role - or lack of it 
OL,11,F- in Craig Bellamy's Wales side.       
OL,13,FIt has meant the midfielder has been   
OL,14,Fthe subject of countless questions     
OL,15,Faround international weeks, the latest 
OL,16,Fprompting the Wales boss to ask a      
OL,17,Fjournalist if he had a Colwill poster  
OL,18,Fin the middle of his bedroom wall.     
